ectives."\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Good progress! You reported status='success' and phase='implementation'. Please continue with the next step. Use the appropriate tools to proceed with implementation. Do not stop until all milestones are complete and status='success' with phase='complete'."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01BDMwyitcUDB4eDLyzcgUpv', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary', 'project_id': '4683ca3b'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01BDMwyitcUDB4eDLyzcgUpv', 'content': '{"success": true, "summary": {"project_id": "4683ca3b", "project_name": "Achievement Toast Customization", "description": "Modify achievement toasts to display agent\'s whimsical name with subtle agent type reference", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-15T02:56:45.173232", "updated_at": "2026-01-15T03:08:01.942001", "task_counts": {"total": 1, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 1, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-15T03:08:01.941997", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Successfully completed milestone 1 planning phase. Created comprehensive architecture document, milestone plan, and coordinated with all three Coordinators to generate detailed task breakdowns. TDD Coordinator has been spawned to begin implementation. All planning documents committed to version control.", "category": "milestone"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:58:52.101003", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Failed to spawn code_writer. System does not recognize this agent type. Attempting alternative approach with Development Manager.", "category": "issue"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-15T02:58:42.730543", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Task \'Implement updated achievement toast display with whimsical agent names\' status: todo \\u2192 in_progress - Retrying Development Manager spawn after previous sys