and Design: Understand current AchievementToast implementation and design enhanced toast component with prominent whimsical agent name display', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'project_description': 'Modify AchievementToast component to display whimsical agent names prominently', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01JkRRiyt8hodmjgaWVuR2NA', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "test_tasks_identified": 12, "coverage_goal": 80, "task_file": "/Users/mattbilsky/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md", "message": "Comprehensive test strategy developed for AchievementToast component enhancement, focusing on whimsical agent name display with robust test coverage and scenarios."}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_018zVX3FEZQUDcbGCCWb7iS3', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/backend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'milestone': 'Component Analysis and Design: Support for enhanced AchievementToast with agent name data', 'architecture': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'project_description': 'Modify AchievementToast component to display whimsical agent names prominently', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_018zVX3FEZQUDcbGCCWb7iS3', 'co