{"timestamp": "2026-01-15 17:30:25", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-097e26e8-97e5-42da-812b-84ba1f23c8cb', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "task": "Enhanced Agent State Persistence - Write tests for agent state tracking with continuation checkpoints that preserve execution context during recovery",\n  "test_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/tests/field/ensemble_ui/backend/test_enhanced_agent_state.py",\n  "code_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/models/agent_state.py",\n  "requirements": {\n    "test_requirements": [\n      "Agent state includes continuation_checkpoint field storing execution context",\n      "State includes recovery_context for recovery-specific metadata",\n      "State includes last_successful_operation for rollback capability",\n      "State includes execution_resumable boolean flag",\n      "State persistence works with existing JSON serialization",\n      "Backward compatibility with existing agent state formats"\n    ],\n    "coverage_target": 90,\n    "test_framework": "pytest",\n    "mock_external_dependencies": true\n  }\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01USgW7znu7jYMaD26DHHYw7', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/models/agent_state.py'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01USgW7znu7jYMaD26DHHYw7', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "File not found: /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ense